pi-data (0.2.0) UNRELEASED; urgency=medium

  * Add pi-geo, moved here from ws-node where it was ws-geoloc. Views and edits
    /etc/geolocation, the GeoClue static location source, interactively or via
    --lat/--lon/--alt/--acc, with --show to read the current values. A machine's
    position is a property of the machine, not of the software deployed on it
  * pi-geo(8) man page, renumbered from section 1 to match pi-data(8)
  * Relicense from GPL-3+ to GPL-2+, matching the rest of WildlifeSystems
  * Correct the copyright holder to Ed Baker. The package was attributed to
    the Natural History Museum, but every commit since the repository was
    created in May 2025 is his

 -- Ed Baker <ed@ebaker.me.uk>  Sat, 12 Sep 2026 16:00:00 +0100

